abstract: >-
  NAAIL OpenLab™ is an independent evidence-governed multi-agent Digital Twin research and education platform for accounting, audit, finance, sustainability, professional simulation, and verifiable human–AI judgment. Public materials describe the platform at a research-safe level. Patent-sensitive unpublished technical details are withheld from public disclosure pending IP review.
